
# Rendered client documents, wherever they land. `client-documents/.gitignore`
# already covers its own; this covers the repository root, which
# `exercise.py` wrote to on its first run before the default was changed.
out/

# Python bytecode. Added 30 Aug 2026 after a `__pycache__` from a one-off run of
# website/build-pricing-config.py was committed by accident -- into website/, the
# one directory the practice-ops side is not permitted to touch, and it made a
# claim repeated several times in this PR ("0 files under website/") false.
# Nothing served it and nothing broke; the point is that no rule existed to stop
# it, which is why this is a line in a file rather than a note to be careful.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Cached source pages fetched by docs/guides/verify_sources.py. Regenerable,
# large, and a snapshot of somebody else's site rather than our work.
docs/guides/.source-cache/
